WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 31]

01:34.640 --> 01:38.000
What has Chen Pingping told you?

01:38.239 --> 01:39.319
Your Majesty.

01:39.959 --> 01:41.279
He told me about

01:41.480 --> 01:43.320
the backgrounds of the three assassins.

01:43.399 --> 01:44.479
Anything else?

01:45.119 --> 01:47.119
He also said that you might be the one

01:47.200 --> 01:49.119
who set the place on fire, Your Majesty.

01:52.879 --> 01:54.880
That old geezer.

01:57.560 --> 01:58.780
What else did he say?

01:58.800 --> 02:00.200
Your Majesty, he even said

02:00.759 --> 02:03.600
that you did so in order
to chase away the Ye family.

02:04.480 --> 02:06.200
It has nothing to do with the Ye family.

02:06.319 --> 02:08.699
But it's related to one
of their family members.

02:08.719 --> 02:09.499
Ye Liuyun?

02:09.519 --> 02:10.939
Ye Liuyun is in Jiangnan.

02:10.959 --> 02:12.460
I heard that
he traveled around the world.

02:12.480 --> 02:14.600
I issued 12 secret edicts for him

02:14.600 --> 02:15.640
to return to the Capital.

02:15.640 --> 02:18.060
But he actually ignored all of them.

02:18.080 --> 02:18.839
He resisted your order?

02:18.839 --> 02:19.939
That's right.

02:19.959 --> 02:21.519
Did you know why?

02:22.480 --> 02:24.659
It's because he's a grandmaster.

02:24.679 --> 02:28.499
Ordinary folks can't go against them.

02:28.519 --> 02:30.939
Sigu Jian alone

02:30.959 --> 02:33.660
has defended Dongyi City for decades.

02:33.680 --> 02:36.100
No one could approach him even with
a million soldiers at their disposal.

02:36.119 --> 02:37.280
You know why?

02:38.160 --> 02:39.639
It's because

02:39.959 --> 02:42.400
they are all grandmasters.

02:45.279 --> 02:46.600
These people

02:46.679 --> 02:48.379
disregard the law

02:48.399 --> 02:51.120
and take rules lightly.

02:59.279 --> 03:01.359
Do you think they're still humans?

03:03.480 --> 03:06.320
Are they tactical weapons, then?

03:09.999 --> 03:11.140
Wrong.

03:11.160 --> 03:13.460
Weapons don't have any emotions.

03:13.480 --> 03:15.140
Maybe their humanity

03:15.160 --> 03:16.880
is the only thing holding them back.

03:17.239 --> 03:19.740
These so-called "grandmasters"

03:19.760 --> 03:22.560
are actually scourges of the world.

03:23.450 --> 03:25.359
If so, why did you
chase the Ye family away?

03:28.399 --> 03:29.920
I want to see if Ye Liuyun

03:29.920 --> 03:32.479
still cares about his kinship.

03:34.519 --> 03:35.979
What if he goes berserk?

03:35.999 --> 03:36.940
How will you clean up the mess?

03:36.959 --> 03:39.400
Some of his family members
are still in the Capital.

03:40.959 --> 03:42.200
You mean Ye Ling'er?

04:04.190 --> 04:06.079
I'll head to Dingzhou together with you.

04:06.719 --> 04:07.799
Ling'er,

04:08.480 --> 04:10.440
I'm sorry.

04:11.320 --> 04:12.799
I'm not making you stay

04:12.999 --> 04:14.680
to protect you.

04:16.079 --> 04:18.120
Do you know why I'm heading to Dingzhou?

04:19.759 --> 04:21.360
You failed to protect His Majesty.

04:23.920 --> 04:25.440
I'm punished for that.

04:25.720 --> 04:28.020
Therefore, one of our family members

04:28.040 --> 04:31.120
has to remain in the Capital.

04:31.840 --> 04:34.759
You're the hostage I've chosen.

04:40.520 --> 04:41.839
As long as you're around,

04:42.920 --> 04:44.560
the ruler can be at ease.

04:53.840 --> 04:54.939
Ling'er,

04:55.480 --> 04:56.599
I'm sorry.

04:58.559 --> 04:59.639
I could only

05:00.639 --> 05:02.159
choose one of us.

05:04.520 --> 05:05.719
From now on,

05:07.079 --> 05:09.560
do not try to be chivalrous again.

05:10.480 --> 05:11.560
Remember,

05:12.239 --> 05:13.440
in the Capital,

05:14.350 --> 05:16.040
it's best for fatherless children

05:16.280 --> 05:17.880
to do nothing.

05:21.960 --> 05:23.279
I understand.

05:28.239 --> 05:31.440
How do you feel
about Second Prince lately?

05:32.160 --> 05:33.680
Why are you asking me that?

05:34.520 --> 05:36.000
You may get married to him,

05:36.040 --> 05:38.839
but do not fall for him.

05:40.319 --> 05:41.480
Why?

05:43.480 --> 05:45.040
If you fall for him,

05:45.520 --> 05:47.240
there'll be no way out.

05:53.920 --> 05:55.240
I understand now.

05:56.160 --> 05:58.000
I'm the out for the Ye family.

06:00.160 --> 06:02.480
I would rather you had no idea.

06:03.079 --> 06:04.599
But there's no choice.

06:04.800 --> 06:06.000
We don't always

06:07.040 --> 06:08.719
get what we wish for.

06:27.800 --> 06:29.159
Don't hate anyone for this.

06:29.999 --> 06:31.399
Live well,

06:32.040 --> 06:33.320
my daughter.

07:08.480 --> 07:10.759
As long as one of them is around,

07:11.280 --> 07:13.920
there'll be room for maneuver, no?

07:15.800 --> 07:18.120
Ye Ling'er is remaining in the Capital

07:18.480 --> 07:20.440
because of her engagement with Chengze.

07:21.030 --> 07:23.880
So you expected this day to arrive
after you granted them the marriage?

07:24.239 --> 07:25.880
Why are you telling me all of this?

07:27.439 --> 07:30.320
We were surrounded by assassins
in the Hanging Temple.

07:30.439 --> 07:31.859
Why did you leave me

07:31.879 --> 07:34.240
and save Chengping instead?

07:40.400 --> 07:41.480
Why?

07:42.559 --> 07:44.260
Back then, if I didn't block the blow

07:44.280 --> 07:46.000
for Third Prince,

07:46.559 --> 07:48.739
he would've been dead.

07:48.759 --> 07:51.920
So, to you, his life
is more important than mine?

07:57.199 --> 07:58.439
They were attacking from both sides.

07:58.439 --> 08:00.159
I could only block one of them.

08:00.559 --> 08:02.820
Back then, that attack
looked more dangerous to me.

08:02.840 --> 08:04.279
I saved Third Prince

08:04.559 --> 08:06.399
as I was going with the flow.

08:06.480 --> 08:09.920
You could've used Chengping
as your shield.

08:10.079 --> 08:12.320
You wouldn't have been hurt by then.

08:12.480 --> 08:14.820
It was sudden.
I didn't think too far ahead.

08:14.840 --> 08:17.120
I was only bent on
blocking the blow and saving him.

08:20.520 --> 08:22.360
Rest well.

08:23.199 --> 08:24.800
Once you get better,

08:24.820 --> 08:25.900
I'll take you

08:26.920 --> 08:28.599
to the place

08:29.119 --> 08:31.040
you wish to go.

08:39.839 --> 08:41.819
When I was in Xinyang, I was wondering

08:41.839 --> 08:44.240
why the emperor granted you
a marriage all of a sudden.

08:46.199 --> 08:49.160
It turns out
that he was using you as a bridge

08:49.800 --> 08:51.880
between the imperial family
and the Ye family.

08:52.359 --> 08:53.959
Judging from its function,

08:54.760 --> 08:56.910
this should be considered
a political marriage.

09:01.040 --> 09:03.320
Why don't I give you
some additional dowries?

09:07.920 --> 09:09.000
Aunt,

09:09.599 --> 09:11.419
we're on the same side here.

09:11.439 --> 09:13.400
You were utterly defeated.

09:13.719 --> 09:15.920
Why should I side
with a useless fool like you?

09:16.439 --> 09:18.520
But you're still living
in my residence, you know?

09:18.520 --> 09:19.350
You can kill me

09:19.370 --> 09:21.000
and vent your frustration, then.

09:21.640 --> 09:23.599
We can't afford to act crazily for real.

09:27.319 --> 09:28.879
Think about yourself.

09:30.319 --> 09:32.119
The engagement is a pact.

09:32.199 --> 09:35.320
If the Ye family gets demoted,
you'll be implicated as well.

09:35.800 --> 09:37.920
As long as they don't
return to the Capital,

09:38.760 --> 09:40.839
you'll stand no chance

09:41.199 --> 09:42.800
to fight for the throne.

09:46.760 --> 09:49.339
But there's one more solution.

09:49.359 --> 09:50.800
Is there even a solution?

09:51.280 --> 09:52.360
Yes.

09:53.199 --> 09:54.800
Just kill Ye Ling'er.

09:55.559 --> 09:57.819
Sever your ties

09:57.839 --> 09:59.599
with the Ye family.

10:05.359 --> 10:06.439
Bi'an.

10:14.559 --> 10:15.610
Head to the Ye family

10:15.630 --> 10:17.290
and relay this message to Ye Ling'er.

10:17.800 --> 10:20.100
Since the engagement is set,
we shall share both wealth and woe.

10:20.120 --> 10:23.599
One day, I'll make sure
the Ye family returns to the Capital.

10:25.120 --> 10:26.210
Aunt,

10:26.230 --> 10:27.800
I believe that offering help

10:27.839 --> 10:30.479
in times of need is better
than adding to someone's prosperity.

10:30.559 --> 10:31.999
Moreover, the Ye family

10:32.479 --> 10:34.160
needs someone to depend on right now.

10:35.839 --> 10:37.260
Isn't it better for you

10:37.280 --> 10:38.760
to kill Ye Ling'er?

10:39.240 --> 10:42.020
If not, you'll be done for as well
when the Ye family falls.

10:42.040 --> 10:43.380
Ye Liuyun is still around.

10:43.400 --> 10:45.119
The Ye family won't fall.

10:45.959 --> 10:47.040
Fine, then.

10:48.160 --> 10:49.280
This is boring.

10:49.559 --> 10:51.400
Aunt, I have a question.

10:51.599 --> 10:54.760
Were you truly intending
to help me out just now?

10:56.079 --> 10:58.299
I just want to see blood being spilled.

10:58.319 --> 11:00.020
Aunt, I'm afraid I have to let you down.

11:00.040 --> 11:02.160
I'll depart for Xinyang right now.

11:03.160 --> 11:04.320
So sudden?

11:04.359 --> 11:05.740
There's no show to enjoy here.

11:05.760 --> 11:07.079
Why should I stay here?

11:15.880 --> 11:16.960
Master.

11:17.439 --> 11:19.079
- Master.
- Master.

11:19.400 --> 11:20.760
- Master.
- Master.

11:21.199 --> 11:22.620
- Master.
- Master.

11:22.640 --> 11:23.879
Master.

11:24.510 --> 11:26.199
A father's love is like a mountain.

11:26.760 --> 11:28.760
You do love your children the most.

11:30.679 --> 11:32.119
Master, you're awake.

11:32.319 --> 11:33.399
Yes.

11:34.560 --> 11:36.520
I have to head
to the Ministry of Revenue.

11:36.599 --> 11:38.339
I need to use the money
Fan Xian gathered

11:38.359 --> 11:40.160
to relieve the disaster victims.

11:42.719 --> 11:43.999
All of you may leave.

11:46.719 --> 11:48.579
Master, you didn't visit Fan Xian
in the palace

11:48.599 --> 11:50.079
or allow me to visit him.

11:50.620 --> 11:52.380
Seems like you made the right choice.

11:53.040 --> 11:54.879
Of course.

11:55.280 --> 11:58.640
We have to think carefully
when he's in the palace.

11:58.959 --> 12:00.879
It was inappropriate indeed.

12:01.160 --> 12:02.839
I'm glad that you figured it out.

12:09.959 --> 12:11.039
What's wrong?

12:11.120 --> 12:13.079
Is my hair messy?

12:13.280 --> 12:16.479
You should change the color
of your hair ornament.

12:16.719 --> 12:18.780
What are you talking about?

12:18.800 --> 12:20.699
Why are you all of you acting strange

12:20.719 --> 12:22.599
after I took a nap?

12:22.679 --> 12:24.020
What's going on?

12:24.040 --> 12:25.500
We've already heard about it.

12:25.520 --> 12:26.959
About what?

12:35.479 --> 12:36.879
Enough already.

12:38.359 --> 12:39.440
Master.

12:40.439 --> 12:42.959
Fan Xian's biological mother,

12:43.359 --> 12:45.280
was she Ye Qingmei?

12:46.479 --> 12:47.659
How did you find out?

12:47.679 --> 12:48.640
That means it's true, then.

12:48.640 --> 12:50.199
This is a huge deal.

12:50.240 --> 12:51.879
Do not spread the news.

12:52.479 --> 12:55.800
But everyone on the streets
is talking about it.

13:00.199 --> 13:01.920
How could that happen?

13:02.280 --> 13:03.839
There's more than that.

13:04.240 --> 13:05.440
What else is there?

13:05.520 --> 13:07.440
Is Fan Xian

13:09.240 --> 13:10.959
His Majesty's son?

13:11.800 --> 13:13.719
Did they talk about that too?

13:16.040 --> 13:18.280
Master, this isn't your fault.

13:18.599 --> 13:20.359
His Majesty was ridiculous.

13:24.880 --> 13:26.670
Relay my message to the residence.

13:27.040 --> 13:29.239
If they hear rumors as such again,

13:29.800 --> 13:31.760
treat them as mere rumors.

13:31.959 --> 13:33.160
Of course.

13:33.839 --> 13:35.400
If it doesn't work out,

13:36.160 --> 13:37.459
I'll be a witness.

13:37.479 --> 13:39.299
At most, I can say
that I gave birth to Fan Xian.

13:39.319 --> 13:40.399
You...

13:40.559 --> 13:41.579
You!

13:41.599 --> 13:44.040
What nonsense are you talking about?

13:45.959 --> 13:47.040
Master,

13:47.240 --> 13:48.400
your hair ornament,

13:48.439 --> 13:51.160
you should change it to another color.
[*Green implies being cheated]

14:02.439 --> 14:03.519
Aunt,

14:03.760 --> 14:06.040
are you truly intending
to return to Xinyang?

14:07.760 --> 14:09.359
Where else can I go?

14:09.479 --> 14:10.599
Seems like

14:11.040 --> 14:12.300
you're moving everything.

14:12.320 --> 14:14.070
What? You can't bear to part with them?

14:14.240 --> 14:15.479
That's not it.

14:16.240 --> 14:17.320
Aunt,

14:17.559 --> 14:19.040
the name list and ledgers

14:19.040 --> 14:21.400
were co-owned by us.

14:21.800 --> 14:24.140
If any of their content is leaked,

14:24.160 --> 14:26.150
being convicted
of colluding with an enemy nation

14:26.150 --> 14:28.370
is considered a minor offense
given the severity of our crime.

14:29.199 --> 14:30.999
Do you think
I'll land myself in trouble?

14:31.199 --> 14:32.480
Of course not.

14:32.500 --> 14:34.220
However, safety should be our priority.

14:34.240 --> 14:36.059
It's because the Capital
is a dangerous place.

14:36.079 --> 14:38.380
That's why I'm going
to look after them for you.

14:38.400 --> 14:39.740
It has already come to this.

14:39.760 --> 14:41.400
Aunt, do you still not trust me?

14:41.520 --> 14:43.020
I would've moved them away in secret

14:43.040 --> 14:44.800
if I didn't trust you.

14:52.920 --> 14:54.000
Wait.

14:54.990 --> 14:56.999
[Red Mansion, Li Yu]
Let me keep these two books.

15:00.150 --> 15:02.020
Your Highness,
I have something to report.

15:02.040 --> 15:03.400
Take care, Aunt. Please come again.

15:03.400 --> 15:05.119
I'm busy. I won't see you off.

15:05.920 --> 15:07.160
Wait.

15:13.800 --> 15:14.959
Give me the books.

15:16.079 --> 15:18.150
At least I have something
to read on my way there.

15:23.920 --> 15:24.539
Speak.

15:24.559 --> 15:25.599
Your Highness, something's off.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.000
Rumors have been
spreading in the capital.

15:27.000 --> 15:27.900
What rumors?

15:27.920 --> 15:29.030
Everyone on the streets is saying

15:29.040 --> 15:31.059
that Fan Xian's biological mother
is Ye Qingmei.

15:31.079 --> 15:32.359
Ye Qingmei?

15:32.400 --> 15:33.840
Fan Jian and Ye Qingmei?

15:33.860 --> 15:35.850
It's no wonder Fan Xian
will inherit the Imperial Treasury.

15:35.870 --> 15:37.280
His father isn't Fan Jian.

15:37.400 --> 15:39.320
They said Fan Xian
was His Majesty's son.

15:39.839 --> 15:41.400
How dare you believe
in such baseless rumors?

15:41.410 --> 15:42.900
The rumors are spreading
across the streets.

15:42.900 --> 15:44.800
The Imperial Inspectorate didn't
explain the situation or stop them.

15:44.810 --> 15:46.540
They would've arrested them
if the rumors were false.

15:46.559 --> 15:47.280
Your Highness,

15:47.300 --> 15:49.600
since they didn't react,
that means the rumors are true.

15:51.240 --> 15:52.320
No wonder.

15:52.520 --> 15:54.400
I knew we were alike.

15:54.959 --> 15:56.320
Stop!

16:02.000 --> 16:03.260
Say that again?

16:03.280 --> 16:04.760
Whose son is he?

16:04.959 --> 16:05.939
His Majesty.

16:05.959 --> 16:07.440
Tell me who his mother is!

16:08.000 --> 16:09.280
It's Ye Qingmei.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.080
You.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.239
Come with me.

16:32.160 --> 16:34.640
Perfumed sachet
and accessories for sale.

16:40.400 --> 16:41.740
This is trespassing!

16:41.760 --> 16:42.659
Stop!

16:42.679 --> 16:51.719
- Stop right there!
- Stop right there!

16:52.880 --> 16:53.960
Stop right there!

17:01.079 --> 17:02.839
This is the Imperial Inspectorate.

17:02.839 --> 17:05.679
What is
the Minister of Revenue doing here?

17:11.430 --> 17:12.770
Keep your weapons away.

17:28.639 --> 17:32.119
Everyone on the streets
knows about Fan Xian's background now.

17:32.639 --> 17:33.319
I know.

17:33.319 --> 17:34.320
So what?

17:34.340 --> 17:35.380
How will you clean up this mess?

17:35.399 --> 17:36.479
And,

17:36.960 --> 17:39.379
the news spread
within the Capital overnight.

17:39.399 --> 17:41.919
It spread too quickly.

17:42.390 --> 17:43.830
You have to investigate it.

17:44.879 --> 17:47.760
Who else can achieve this
besides the Imperial Inspectorate?

17:58.000 --> 17:59.280
It was you.

17:59.559 --> 18:02.639
To put it more accurately,
the news should've only been spread

18:02.720 --> 18:05.079
within the Capital after the hour of Wu.

18:05.079 --> 18:06.500
Was it His Majesty's intention?

18:06.520 --> 18:09.500
We can only do it
with His Majesty's permission.

18:09.520 --> 18:10.879
But why?

18:11.000 --> 18:13.079
Fan Xian risked his life to save him.

18:14.870 --> 18:16.299
His Majesty was touched by his effort.

18:16.319 --> 18:18.599
Why is he pushing him off a cliff, then?

18:20.280 --> 18:22.040
From a subject to a prince,

18:22.240 --> 18:23.920
that's a promotion in one's identity.

18:24.760 --> 18:27.099
Fan Xian's background
was kept hidden all these years

18:27.119 --> 18:29.180
in order to ensure his safety.

18:29.200 --> 18:31.740
Do you know what the name
"Ye Qingmei" implies?

18:31.760 --> 18:35.220
There are as many people who love her
as there are people who hate her.

18:35.240 --> 18:36.780
Hatred,

18:36.800 --> 18:39.960
it never fades
once it's rooted in our hearts.

18:48.800 --> 18:49.919
I know that.

18:54.960 --> 18:56.040
I know that.

18:58.559 --> 18:59.740
I want him dead!

18:59.760 --> 19:00.840
Aunt,

19:00.879 --> 19:01.619
calm down.

19:01.639 --> 19:03.079
I'm calm right now!

19:03.680 --> 19:06.130
Ye Qingmei's son has to die.

19:06.150 --> 19:08.639
No wonder he wants
to hand the Imperial Treasury to him.

19:08.879 --> 19:10.539
He's just returning it
to its rightful owner.

19:10.559 --> 19:12.020
With Fan Xian's current identity,

19:12.040 --> 19:13.740
His Majesty won't
allow anyone to kill him.

19:13.760 --> 19:16.040
But His Majesty owes me for this!

19:17.159 --> 19:18.439
All these years,

19:19.520 --> 19:21.460
I provided His Majesty
with whatever he desired.

19:21.480 --> 19:24.240
I was the one
who did the dirty deeds for him.

19:24.359 --> 19:26.740
I investigated the people
he didn't want to investigate.

19:26.760 --> 19:28.800
It was me! Not anyone else!

19:29.879 --> 19:32.000
I devoted my entire being
to His Majesty alone.

19:32.599 --> 19:34.740
Even if he wanted
to chase me out of the capital,

19:34.760 --> 19:36.420
I also obliged his will!

19:36.440 --> 19:37.639
Aunt.

19:42.319 --> 19:43.800
This isn't the end yet.

19:45.159 --> 19:47.200
Even if I'm not in the Capital,

19:47.399 --> 19:49.740
I'm still His Majesty's dagger.

19:49.760 --> 19:51.630
He wanted to abolish the prime minister.

19:51.810 --> 19:53.859
Therefore, I told Yuan Hongdao
to collaborate with him.

19:53.879 --> 19:55.800
Aunt, wasn't that your intention?

19:58.639 --> 20:00.280
Why would I do so?

20:01.119 --> 20:03.480
It was even between me
and that Lin fellow long ago.

20:04.240 --> 20:06.079
He was the one
who wanted to abolish him.

20:06.720 --> 20:08.740
If not, I wouldn't have
instructed Yuan Hongdao

20:08.760 --> 20:10.879
to serve that Lin fellow
for so many years.

20:11.359 --> 20:12.919
It was me.

20:13.119 --> 20:14.480
All these years,

20:14.639 --> 20:17.280
I did everything he asked me to do.

20:18.280 --> 20:20.020
But now, he still wants

20:20.040 --> 20:22.159
to let the son of that woman

20:22.319 --> 20:25.119
to steal the Imperial Treasury from me.

20:28.000 --> 20:29.480
This time,

20:30.079 --> 20:32.159
I don't care what His Majesty wants.

20:32.760 --> 20:34.800
I want Fan Xian dead.

20:36.359 --> 20:37.720
Fan Xian is in the palace.

20:38.079 --> 20:39.599
How do you plan to kill him?

20:43.800 --> 20:45.460
Is he in my Guangxin Palace?

20:45.480 --> 20:46.599
That's right.

21:00.720 --> 21:02.399
Fan Xian is living

21:03.960 --> 21:05.480
in my Guangxin Palace?

21:07.359 --> 21:09.000
He chased me away

21:10.319 --> 21:12.119
and robbed me of my residence, huh?

21:15.119 --> 21:16.199
Wait.

21:16.520 --> 21:17.600
Wait.

21:18.350 --> 21:20.580
Actually, if we look at it
from another perspective,

21:22.159 --> 21:23.359
Crown Prince should be the one

21:23.359 --> 21:25.560
panicking about Fan Xian's identity.

21:37.200 --> 21:38.800
I want him dead.

21:57.200 --> 21:59.320
Your Highness, Her Majesty has arrived.

21:59.599 --> 22:01.500
You fools. Why didn't you
notify me in advance?

22:01.520 --> 22:03.800
I told them not to do so.

22:03.960 --> 22:05.040
What's wrong?

22:05.119 --> 22:07.119
Do you not welcome me?

22:07.520 --> 22:08.600
Mother.

22:11.200 --> 22:12.280
Greetings,

22:13.720 --> 22:14.919
Mother.

22:17.040 --> 22:18.359
All of you may leave.

22:26.800 --> 22:28.020
Don't close the door.

22:28.040 --> 22:29.630
Mother is afraid of the dark.

22:34.359 --> 22:36.680
Mother, it's been some time
since you left your residence.

22:36.960 --> 22:38.520
Were you

22:38.839 --> 22:39.660
panicking?

22:39.680 --> 22:41.500
Have you heard of
the incident with Fan Xian?

22:41.520 --> 22:43.280
I was just about to look for you.

22:44.040 --> 22:45.780
Fan Xian is in charge
of the Imperial Treasury.

22:45.800 --> 22:47.550
And, he's taking over
the Imperial Inspectorate too.

22:47.559 --> 22:50.679
Right now, he has more power
than Li Chengze.

22:51.040 --> 22:52.619
How could you rest at ease

22:52.639 --> 22:53.610
if the rumors were true?

22:53.630 --> 22:55.890
Let's not talk about the validity
of the rumors for now.

22:56.000 --> 22:58.079
It's fine even if they were true.

22:58.399 --> 22:59.760
I'm competing with Chengze

22:59.879 --> 23:03.899
because he's trying to steal
the things that don't belong to him.

23:03.919 --> 23:05.839
What if Fan Xian is a prince as well?

23:05.919 --> 23:07.280
His surname is Fan.

23:07.919 --> 23:09.619
Even if the entire world knows

23:09.639 --> 23:11.300
that he's my brother,

23:11.320 --> 23:12.660
he has no right to compete with me

23:12.680 --> 23:14.439
as long as his surname is Fan.

23:17.119 --> 23:19.740
An illegitimate bloodline
cannot enter the imperial family.

23:19.760 --> 23:21.579
Mother, with his bloodline, at most,

23:21.599 --> 23:22.867
he can only take over

23:22.868 --> 23:24.700
the Imperial Treasury
and Imperial Inspectorate.

23:24.720 --> 23:26.420
That's all he can do.

23:26.440 --> 23:28.560
If so, I should side with him instead.

23:29.159 --> 23:30.859
He hates Chengze. I hate Chengze too.

23:30.879 --> 23:32.679
We're born to be allies.

23:34.720 --> 23:36.879
What if I want Fan Xian dead?

23:39.919 --> 23:41.200
Is it because

23:41.440 --> 23:42.440
of his bloodline?

23:42.440 --> 23:44.879
It's because he's the son of Ye Qingmei.

23:47.240 --> 23:49.059
Didn't Ye Qingmei die a long time ago?

23:49.079 --> 23:51.119
There are plenty of concubines
in the palace.

23:51.240 --> 23:53.000
I don't think she's that big of a deal,

23:53.200 --> 23:54.280
Mother.

23:58.319 --> 23:59.760
Ye Qingmei

24:00.599 --> 24:02.119
died because of me.

24:03.119 --> 24:04.599
Although no one mentioned

24:04.680 --> 24:05.879
Ye Qingmei's death again,

24:05.879 --> 24:07.760
I do know some facts about it.

24:08.119 --> 24:11.200
Back then, she died at the hands
of the empress and her clan, right?

24:12.839 --> 24:15.960
Due to that, the empress's clan
was massacred.

24:16.480 --> 24:18.399
If so, wouldn't it be better for us
to observe

24:18.520 --> 24:20.359
and wait for the empress to strike?

24:22.319 --> 24:26.079
The empress's devious plots
are impressive indeed.

24:26.879 --> 24:29.350
However, this is the only thing
I cannot put any hope on her.

24:29.960 --> 24:31.040
But why?

24:31.119 --> 24:32.859
It's because she has someone
she cares about.

24:32.879 --> 24:33.780
Do you not have one?

24:33.800 --> 24:34.880
I do.

24:35.760 --> 24:37.040
I care about Ye Qingmei.

24:38.720 --> 24:40.639
I want her son to vanish

24:40.839 --> 24:42.879
from this world.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.760
That means

24:59.845 --> 25:02.740
your clanfolk were the ones
who killed Ye Qingmei.

25:02.760 --> 25:04.919
You didn't kill her personally.

25:05.359 --> 25:06.520
That's right.

25:07.240 --> 25:08.839
If so, was your clan

25:09.240 --> 25:11.040
massacred?

25:11.079 --> 25:12.639
My entire clan

25:13.079 --> 25:14.800
was wiped out overnight.

25:15.720 --> 25:17.879
If so, I guess it's all in the past now.

25:21.399 --> 25:22.599
All in the past?

25:24.720 --> 25:26.000
That night,

25:26.660 --> 25:29.079
the Black Cavalries were searching
the entire Capital.

25:30.399 --> 25:32.379
They even stormed into the palace

25:32.399 --> 25:34.159
and trespassed upon my residence.

25:34.680 --> 25:36.079
I wanted to stop them,

25:36.480 --> 25:37.879
but to no avail.

25:39.159 --> 25:42.919
They knocked over the lamps
in front of me.

25:43.639 --> 25:46.320
They made the servants cover my eyes.

25:46.960 --> 25:48.379
I could only hear

25:48.399 --> 25:51.439
the terrifying wails of my kin
as they were slaughtered.

25:53.879 --> 25:55.679
There was no light,

25:55.960 --> 25:57.720
and the moon was covered by the clouds.

25:58.800 --> 26:00.560
Although the sky was dark,

26:01.839 --> 26:04.119
although my eyes were covered,

26:04.559 --> 26:06.560
I could still see.

26:07.200 --> 26:08.919
Blood was the only thing I saw.

26:09.800 --> 26:11.480
Blood was everywhere.

26:15.680 --> 26:16.919
Do you think

26:19.480 --> 26:21.300
all of that is in the past now?

26:21.320 --> 26:22.899
If so, I suppose you weren't the one

26:22.919 --> 26:24.839
who ordered your men
to take her life, right?

26:25.359 --> 26:26.599
Does that even matter?

26:28.839 --> 26:31.599
If so, that means
you're not related to the incident.

26:31.919 --> 26:33.059
By the way,

26:33.079 --> 26:35.200
I suppose not many people
know about this, right?

26:36.159 --> 26:37.320
That's right.

26:37.680 --> 26:39.159
If so, it'll be safer.

26:41.559 --> 26:43.119
Now that the culprit is dead,

26:44.520 --> 26:46.339
bygones are bygones.

26:46.359 --> 26:49.619
If so, Fan Xian and I can
focus on the common enemy.

26:49.639 --> 26:51.240
We can deal with Chengze together.

26:52.480 --> 26:54.240
The culprit is dead?

26:55.119 --> 26:56.879
Bygones are bygones?

26:59.680 --> 27:01.679
But they're my family.

27:02.599 --> 27:04.240
They're your family too.

27:04.800 --> 27:07.439
But what should I do
if Fan Xian finds out about this

27:08.200 --> 27:10.280
and falls out with me?

27:17.599 --> 27:19.079
What should I do, then?

27:26.079 --> 27:27.159
Mother,

27:27.639 --> 27:28.800
what about this?

27:29.559 --> 27:31.060
You should

27:31.080 --> 27:32.399
apologize to Fan Xian.

27:32.480 --> 27:33.560
You see,

27:34.240 --> 27:36.280
this incident happened a long time ago.

27:36.599 --> 27:38.220
And, the perpetrators

27:38.240 --> 27:39.819
had paid the price with their lives.

27:39.839 --> 27:42.099
Since you didn't kill her

27:42.119 --> 27:43.760
or order your men to take her life,

27:44.520 --> 27:46.200
why don't we

27:46.399 --> 27:47.800
lay it all out

27:48.359 --> 27:49.780
and apologize to Fan Xian?

27:49.800 --> 27:51.720
This incident will be over by then.

27:58.839 --> 28:00.200
What did you say?

28:01.839 --> 28:03.879
You want me to apologize to him?

28:10.119 --> 28:11.199
Mother,

28:11.240 --> 28:12.639
I know my fault.

28:13.280 --> 28:15.159
Plenty of our family members had died.

28:15.639 --> 28:17.800
I'm also disheartened by it.

28:18.280 --> 28:20.439
But Chengze has his eyes on my position.

28:20.680 --> 28:22.119
He's keeping a close eye on me.

28:22.390 --> 28:24.680
I may lose my position
as the Crown Prince at any time.

28:24.720 --> 28:27.359
I'm seeking Fan Xian's help

28:27.599 --> 28:29.679
because I have no other choices, Mother.

28:37.879 --> 28:38.959
Mother,

28:39.680 --> 28:41.079
please trust me.

28:41.359 --> 28:42.560
If, one day,

28:43.559 --> 28:45.240
when push comes to shove,

28:45.599 --> 28:47.420
I'll definitely kill Fan Xian myself

28:47.440 --> 28:49.000
and avenge our family.

28:52.200 --> 28:54.159
Weren't you the one who taught me

28:54.960 --> 28:58.240
that those who want to achieve great feats

28:59.399 --> 29:01.320
have to first endure?

29:37.960 --> 29:39.560
You're right about everything.

29:41.680 --> 29:43.159
I'm relieved.

29:45.599 --> 29:48.480
So you're the one
who resembles him the most.

29:53.879 --> 29:54.959
Mother.

29:56.720 --> 29:58.200
I can only say these words

30:00.280 --> 30:02.280
in front of you.

30:03.960 --> 30:05.679
It's because

30:06.240 --> 30:08.280
I'm your only kin

30:10.520 --> 30:12.879
in the world now.

30:30.520 --> 30:31.600
All right.

30:32.879 --> 30:34.320
You'll get

30:35.200 --> 30:36.720
what you wish for.

30:49.720 --> 30:52.099
You should stop kowtowing.
This is inappropriate.

30:52.119 --> 30:53.720
It's more than appropriate.

30:53.760 --> 30:55.480
You saved his life after all.

30:55.720 --> 30:57.960
Even so, he didn't need to kowtow to me.

30:58.280 --> 31:00.240
It's fine.
He's doing it of his own accord.

31:00.600 --> 31:02.379
Chengping has been
talking about you every day

31:02.399 --> 31:04.439
ever since you saved him.

31:05.639 --> 31:06.660
By the way,

31:06.680 --> 31:08.679
does your wound still hurt?

31:09.240 --> 31:10.320
I'm fine now.

31:17.000 --> 31:18.080
He fainted.

31:18.320 --> 31:20.200
It's fine.
He can continue after some rest.

31:20.599 --> 31:22.539
Where are Wan'er and Ruoruo?

31:22.559 --> 31:23.960
I don't see them around.

31:24.240 --> 31:27.139
Ruoruo? The imperial physician
wanted to learn medical skills from her.

31:27.159 --> 31:28.379
You're something else.

31:28.399 --> 31:29.899
Why are you imparting
your surgical skill

31:29.919 --> 31:31.020
to other people?

31:31.040 --> 31:32.919
We practice medicine to save lives.

31:33.760 --> 31:34.930
What about Wan'er?

31:34.950 --> 31:36.299
She went home to take some clothing.

31:36.319 --> 31:37.539
I was thinking

31:37.559 --> 31:38.930
that I have to stay here for some time.

31:38.950 --> 31:40.500
I should bring
the wheelchair here as well.

31:40.520 --> 31:41.940
You have a wheelchair in your house?

31:41.960 --> 31:44.359
Mr. Chen gave me one
when I was feigning illness.

31:59.680 --> 32:02.280
Are the rumors true?

32:03.200 --> 32:04.439
I don't know.

32:05.119 --> 32:06.520
If they're true,

32:06.919 --> 32:10.839
that means you and Chengping
will have a closer relationship.

32:11.200 --> 32:12.560
I truly have no idea.

32:13.440 --> 32:15.599
I want Chengping to be your student.

32:16.520 --> 32:17.680
Why don't you ask him about it

32:17.680 --> 32:18.840
after he regains consciousness?

32:18.860 --> 32:20.520
It's... It's time to take your medicine.

32:21.319 --> 32:23.639
It's fine. I can make the call for him.

32:25.680 --> 32:28.679
Why... Why don't you take it now?

32:39.440 --> 32:41.520
Why did you have to poison me?

32:48.879 --> 32:50.800
Let go of me!

32:52.240 --> 32:54.079
Mr. Fan, let me go!

32:54.079 --> 32:56.200
How could they try
to poison you in the palace?

32:56.359 --> 32:57.879
Mr. Fan!

33:03.839 --> 33:05.359
Mr. Fan!

33:10.839 --> 33:11.960
Leave!

33:18.680 --> 33:20.119
What are you doing here?

33:21.280 --> 33:22.220
Gong Dian was demoted.

33:22.240 --> 33:23.500
I'm taking over for the time being.

33:23.520 --> 33:24.579
Rest at ease.

33:24.599 --> 33:25.960
I'll deter the assassins.

33:26.390 --> 33:27.980
These two aren't
the only assassins today.

33:28.000 --> 33:29.099
Those assassins

33:29.119 --> 33:30.680
have worked in Guangxin Palace
for many years.

33:30.690 --> 33:32.100
The mastermind must be
someone I know, then.

33:32.119 --> 33:34.020
I'll swap out all the personnel
in Guangxin Palace.

33:34.040 --> 33:35.859
I'll also report this to Father.

33:35.879 --> 33:37.099
I'll surely give you an account.

33:37.119 --> 33:38.199
Thank you.

33:41.670 --> 33:43.400
Do you need an imperial physician?

33:45.240 --> 33:46.320
It's fine.

33:46.879 --> 33:48.560
He's not done kowtowing yet.

33:56.359 --> 33:58.520
You saw for yourself
the situation I'm in.

33:58.760 --> 34:01.480
Third Prince will be in danger
if he stays close to me.

34:03.960 --> 34:04.940
You see,

34:04.960 --> 34:07.139
you're the only person
in the imperial court

34:07.159 --> 34:09.760
who can protect him now.

34:22.439 --> 34:23.959
You should stop now.

34:24.800 --> 34:26.720
One has to be sincere
when being a student.

34:26.839 --> 34:28.240
We made a promise.

34:28.400 --> 34:29.459
It'll only count when he faints.

34:29.479 --> 34:30.660
He fainted just now.

34:30.680 --> 34:32.879
He's awake now.
That means it doesn't count.

34:33.800 --> 34:35.800
Don't you feel sorry
for your son at all?

34:37.399 --> 34:38.760
Mothers have to be strong.

34:42.080 --> 34:43.220
Put your back into it.

34:43.240 --> 34:44.640
It's not loud enough.

34:47.879 --> 34:49.680
According to His Majesty's oral edict,

34:49.959 --> 34:52.180
the Capital is too crowded.

34:52.200 --> 34:53.899
It's complex and unsafe.

34:53.919 --> 34:56.039
It's time to pull the weeds.

34:56.640 --> 34:57.620
Excuse me,

34:57.640 --> 34:58.899
but how do I pull the weeds?

34:58.919 --> 35:02.299
Second Prince,
please inspect your residence

35:02.319 --> 35:03.700
and see if there's anyone

35:03.720 --> 35:06.220
who shouldn't be in the Capital.

35:06.240 --> 35:09.939
If so, please send them out
of the Capital immediately.

35:09.959 --> 35:11.600
There's no need to pull the weeds.

35:11.640 --> 35:13.879
You can just designate me.

35:14.399 --> 35:15.379
Sir, don't worry.

35:15.399 --> 35:17.640
I'll surely inspect
the residence thoroughly.

35:18.319 --> 35:19.859
I've already relayed the message.

35:19.879 --> 35:21.959
I shall take my leave now.

35:24.399 --> 35:25.640
Sir, take care.

35:27.039 --> 35:29.240
Make her leave as soon as possible.

35:39.839 --> 35:40.960
Aunt,

35:41.839 --> 35:44.060
assassinating Fan Xian is a huge deal.

35:44.080 --> 35:45.519
I didn't do it.

35:45.919 --> 35:47.359
Those assassins in Guangxin Palace

35:47.359 --> 35:48.600
served you for many years.

35:48.610 --> 35:51.430
Although they said they did it
of their own accord, who would trust them?

35:51.959 --> 35:54.720
Do you think I'm dumb enough
to resort to using maids and eunuchs?

35:55.399 --> 35:58.080
Moreover, I know that
Fan Xian is a poison practitioner.

35:58.319 --> 35:59.800
Why would I try to poison him?

36:00.640 --> 36:02.080
Who else could it be, then?

36:03.479 --> 36:04.800
I may be crazy,

36:04.959 --> 36:06.280
but I'm not foolish.

36:07.399 --> 36:09.559
Are you saying
that the empress is behind this?

36:10.080 --> 36:11.420
That doesn't make sense.

36:11.440 --> 36:13.999
Why would the empress
take the assassination this lightly?

36:14.200 --> 36:15.479
It's hard to say.

36:15.680 --> 36:17.280
I'm too lazy to take a guess either.

36:18.039 --> 36:19.119
Aunt,

36:19.150 --> 36:20.959
His Majesty is forcing you
to return to Xinyang now.

36:20.959 --> 36:22.519
What do you plan to do?

36:22.930 --> 36:25.230
If Fan Xian wants
to take over the Imperial Treasury,

36:25.319 --> 36:27.459
he has to take over
the Three Great Workshops first.

36:27.479 --> 36:29.240
He'll surely head to Jiangnan.

36:29.750 --> 36:32.190
It might be inconvenient for me
to kill him in the Capital,

36:32.359 --> 36:34.439
but Jiangnan is a convenient location.

36:35.039 --> 36:36.130
That's hard to say.

36:36.150 --> 36:37.240
Although he lost his martial arts,

36:37.240 --> 36:39.240
he still has plenty of bodyguards.

36:40.519 --> 36:42.280
Ye Liuyun is in Jiangnan.

36:44.720 --> 36:45.800
What?

36:46.560 --> 36:49.120
Aunt, are you saying
that the grandmaster will help you out?

36:49.880 --> 36:51.280
Why don't you take a guess?

36:58.359 --> 37:00.379
Aunt, we've been allies for a long time.

37:00.399 --> 37:02.559
But how many secrets
are you keeping from me?

37:05.039 --> 37:07.879
Aunt, do you plan
to wait for Fan Xian in Jiangnan?

37:08.080 --> 37:11.439
Today, I'll return to Xinyang.

37:12.039 --> 37:14.819
If anything happens to Fan Xian
while he's in Jiangnan,

37:14.839 --> 37:16.800
it has nothing to do with me.

37:22.439 --> 37:23.979
You're on your own now.

37:23.999 --> 37:25.559
I'll leave the Capital today.

37:25.800 --> 37:27.080
I won't see you off, then.

37:27.800 --> 37:28.939
I'll also give it a try.

37:28.959 --> 37:30.839
Aunt, you can rest
if I'm able to kill Fan Xian

37:30.839 --> 37:32.479
in the Capital.

37:33.560 --> 37:34.919
How do you plan to do it?

37:35.479 --> 37:36.839
Will you enter the palace?

37:38.200 --> 37:39.479
I'm not foolish either.

37:47.039 --> 37:48.600
Madam Liu, please stop.

37:48.600 --> 37:49.640
We have more than enough here.

37:49.660 --> 37:50.780
We'll only be away for a few days.

37:50.800 --> 37:51.819
We'll return soon.

37:51.839 --> 37:53.280
Who can say for sure?

37:53.519 --> 37:54.600
Wan'er,

37:54.640 --> 37:57.540
I suppose you've heard of the rumors
related to Fan Xian's background.

37:57.560 --> 37:58.760
I have.

37:59.319 --> 38:00.100
Say,

38:00.120 --> 38:02.959
do you think he'll remain
in the palace after this?

38:05.600 --> 38:07.280
He'll definitely come back.

38:07.680 --> 38:09.320
Are you saying

38:09.359 --> 38:11.240
that the rumors were false?

38:11.720 --> 38:13.379
I don't know if they're false or not.

38:13.399 --> 38:16.080
But, it doesn't matter anyway.

38:16.600 --> 38:18.140
Silly girl,

38:18.160 --> 38:20.090
how could it not matter?

38:20.110 --> 38:21.580
We bowed to you and his father

38:21.600 --> 38:24.019
in the Fan's Residence
during our wedding.

38:24.039 --> 38:26.680
His surname is Fan,
and that cannot be changed.

38:28.519 --> 38:29.620
How did you know?

38:29.640 --> 38:30.859
Did he tell you about it?

38:30.879 --> 38:32.019
He didn't need to tell me.

38:32.039 --> 38:33.540
I understand Fan Xian.

38:33.560 --> 38:35.160
I'm sure he'll make that choice.

38:40.600 --> 38:42.700
That boy is truly lucky

38:42.720 --> 38:44.160
to get you as his wife.

38:46.560 --> 38:47.810
I'm the lucky one here.

38:47.830 --> 38:49.800
I'm lucky enough
to have encountered him.

39:03.640 --> 39:05.280
Why did you stop the carriage...

39:08.919 --> 39:10.280
Cousin Chengze?

39:10.319 --> 39:12.919
Fan Xian and his men
killed your brother, Lin Gong.

39:16.240 --> 39:17.800
Fan Xian already knew the truth

39:17.919 --> 39:20.459
behind the assassination on Niulan Street
before your brother died.

39:20.479 --> 39:22.200
He deceived everyone.

39:28.230 --> 39:29.339
Please get off the carriage.

39:29.359 --> 39:31.000
Ling'er knows about that as well.

39:33.160 --> 39:34.519
If you don't believe me,

39:34.680 --> 39:36.839
you can confront Ling'er.

39:36.879 --> 39:38.320
You'll know the truth by then.

39:41.160 --> 39:42.939
Since when did you hear about the news?

39:42.959 --> 39:44.600
It has been some time.

39:44.790 --> 39:46.460
Why didn't you tell me about it
before the wedding?

39:46.479 --> 39:47.480
Someone requested me to keep quiet.

39:47.490 --> 39:49.939
Moreover, it's pointless for me
to tell you about it back then.

39:49.959 --> 39:52.339
You're just trying to use someone else
to do the dirty work for you.

39:52.359 --> 39:55.359
Don't you wish
to avenge your closest kin?

40:01.319 --> 40:02.260
Wan'er,

40:02.280 --> 40:03.640
have you forgotten?

40:03.959 --> 40:05.399
Your surname is Lin.

40:06.480 --> 40:07.680
Stop the carriage.

40:35.800 --> 40:37.919
Sir, your handwriting is excellent.

40:43.720 --> 40:45.590
There's no need
to butter me up forcefully.

40:47.879 --> 40:49.479
Yes, sir.

40:50.080 --> 40:51.640
You can skip the formalities.

40:52.600 --> 40:53.780
Once a teacher,

40:53.800 --> 40:54.899
always a teacher.

40:54.919 --> 40:55.979
I have to respect you.

40:55.999 --> 40:57.459
Our seniority is all mixed up now.

40:57.479 --> 40:58.660
Speaking of which,

40:58.680 --> 41:00.700
I don't know
what I can teach you either.

41:00.720 --> 41:02.399
You have your own habits

41:02.900 --> 41:05.070
when it comes
to dealing with matters and people.

41:05.720 --> 41:07.160
Mother told me

41:07.200 --> 41:09.299
to do whatever you tell me to do

41:09.319 --> 41:10.130
without

41:10.150 --> 41:11.519
questioning anything.

41:13.720 --> 41:16.320
If so, please deliver this letter
to the Imperial Inspectorate.

41:17.919 --> 41:18.780
Me?

41:18.800 --> 41:19.999
You want me to go?

41:20.879 --> 41:22.160
Why don't I go, then?

41:22.720 --> 41:25.660
I heard that the Imperial Inspectorate
is filled with blood and horror.

41:25.680 --> 41:26.560
Is that true?

41:26.580 --> 41:28.019
Give it back if you're scared.

41:28.039 --> 41:29.119
No.

41:29.200 --> 41:30.399
Sir, I'll listen to you.

41:32.399 --> 41:33.980
Once you're there,

41:34.000 --> 41:35.710
tell them to deliver this letter

41:36.280 --> 41:38.800
to Northern Qi.

41:40.600 --> 41:41.899
To whom in Northern Qi?

41:41.919 --> 41:43.280
Haitang Duoduo.

41:44.879 --> 41:45.959
Sir,

41:46.120 --> 41:47.240
I understand now.

41:49.160 --> 41:50.479
What do you understand?

41:50.760 --> 41:52.640
I'll definitely protect this letter.

41:53.640 --> 41:55.859
Are you misunderstanding something here?

41:55.879 --> 41:56.979
I'll head there right now.

41:56.999 --> 41:58.819
No need for that. It's late now.

41:58.839 --> 42:00.190
You can do it tomorrow.

42:04.240 --> 42:04.990
Sir,

42:05.010 --> 42:06.100
I'll take my leave first.

42:06.120 --> 42:07.720
Don't worry.
I'll surely fulfill your request.

42:07.720 --> 42:08.840
Go now.

42:10.319 --> 42:11.600
Good night, Madam.

42:11.640 --> 42:12.839
I shall take my leave.

42:25.439 --> 42:27.080
What request was he talking about?

42:28.090 --> 42:30.810
Telling the Imperial Inspectorate
to deliver the letter to Haitang Duoduo.

42:30.830 --> 42:32.380
What did you write in the letter?

42:33.080 --> 42:35.959
Master Ku He has a technique
called One Heaven.

42:35.959 --> 42:38.580
Rumor has it that it can reconstruct
one's body and meridians.

42:39.150 --> 42:40.459
I'm trying to see if there's a way

42:40.479 --> 42:42.880
for me to learn it from him
in exchange for something else.

42:43.120 --> 42:45.080
I can't just keep being useless forever.

42:45.800 --> 42:47.499
I heard that Ku He never imparted

42:47.519 --> 42:49.240
that technique to any outsiders.

42:49.919 --> 42:51.640
I have to give it a try somehow.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.143 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
